-- replace it. Rules the schema guard enforces:
--   * tenant_id NOT NULL DEFAULT platform.current_tenant_id()
--   * primary key, unique indexes and foreign keys lead with tenant_id
--   * ENABLE + FORCE row level security with the canonical policy
--   * explicit minimal grants to app_rw; never TRUNCATE
-- Migrations are immutable once merged: fix forward with a new migration.
